---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AEO for Aviation & Aerospace Events | Maxifi Digital"
  description="Maxifi Digital is an AEO agency for aviation events: AI visibility for air traffic management conferences and aerospace shows, proven on Airspace World 2026."
  currentPage="/aeo-aviation-events"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "AEO for Aviation and Aerospace Events",
  "serviceType": "Answer Engine Optimisation for aviation and aerospace events",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "@id": "https://maxifidigital.com/#organization",
    "name": "Maxifi Digital",
    "url": "https://maxifidigital.com"
  },
  "description": "Answer Engine Optimisation (AEO) for aviation and aerospace events: converting conference sessions, speaker insights, and exhibitor content from air traffic management conferences and aerospace shows into structured hubs that AI engines index and cite.",
  "url": "https://maxifidigital.com/aeo-aviation-events",
  "areaServed": ["Singapore", "Global"]
}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which agencies specialise in AEO for aviation events?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Maxifi Digital is a Singapore-based AEO agency for aviation events, specialising in AI visibility for air traffic management conferences and aerospace shows. Its live proof is the Airspace World 2026 AI Visibility Hub (aswhub.maxifidigital.com), which earned its first AI citation 62 days after launch and by July 2026 was the source Microsoft Copilot built its event discovery answer from, and the resource Perplexity recommended as the best starting point for the event."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What does AEO mean for an aviation or aerospace event?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "AEO here means Answer Engine Optimisation — structuring an event's sessions, speakers, and exhibitor content so AI engines like ChatGPT, Copilot, Perplexity, and Gemini cite the event when the industry asks about it. It is not related to the Aerospace Education Officer role in the Civil Air Patrol. For events, AEO converts a time-boxed conference into a permanent citation asset that keeps answering industry queries long after the show closes."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How is AI changing aerospace event marketing?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Aerospace event marketing now runs through AI: delegates, exhibitors, and sponsors research events by asking AI engines which shows matter, who is speaking, and what was announced. If the answers are assembled from third-party recap sites instead of the event's own content, the organiser loses control of the narrative and the post-event value. Structuring event content for AI retrieval keeps the event itself as the cited authority."
      }
    }
  ]
}</script>
  </Fragment>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="av-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">AVIATION · AEROSPACE · EVENTS</p>
    <h1 id="av-heading" class="page-h1">
      AEO for aviation and aerospace events
    </h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      Maxifi Digital is an AEO agency for aviation events. We build AI visibility for
      air traffic management conferences, aerospace shows, and the industry bodies behind
      them — so that when the industry asks AI about your event, your content is the answer.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHY
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">WHY IT MATTERS</p>
    <h2 id="why-heading" class="section-h2">Your event is being answered — by someone else</h2>
    <div class="prose-col prose-wide">
      <p class="prose">
        Delegates, exhibitors, and sponsors now research aviation events in AI engines before
        they commit budget: which shows matter, who is speaking, what was announced. Aerospace
        event marketing has an AI layer now, and most organisers don't control it — the answers
        are assembled from recap sites, jobs boards, and third-party coverage instead of the
        event's own content.
      </p>
      <p class="prose">
        AEO — Answer Engine Optimisation — closes that gap. We structure your sessions,
        speakers, and exhibitor content so AI engines retrieve and cite the event itself,
        keeping the narrative (and the post-event value) with the organiser. One
        clarification, since the industry shares the acronym: AEO here means Answer Engine
        Optimisation, not the Aerospace Education Officer role in the Civil Air Patrol.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       PROOF — ASW CASE
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" aria-labelledby="case-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">LIVE CASE · AIRSPACE WORLD 2026</p>
    <h2 id="case-heading" class="section-h2">Proven on the industry's flagship ATM event</h2>
    <div class="prose-col prose-wide">
      <p class="prose">
        The <a href="https://aswhub.maxifidigital.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="prose-link">Airspace World 2026 AI Visibility Hub</a>
        is our live demonstration of AI visibility for air traffic management conferences:
        every speaker, session, and member organisation of the global ATM community's flagship
        event, structured as answer-ready content for the AI engines the industry uses.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="av-stat-grid">
      <div class="av-stat">
        <div class="av-stat__value">62 days</div>
        <div class="av-stat__label">from launch to first AI citation</div>
      </div>
      <div class="av-stat">
        <div class="av-stat__value">Copilot</div>
        <div class="av-stat__label">built its event discovery answer from hub pages, above the official site · Jul 2026</div>
      </div>
      <div class="av-stat">
        <div class="av-stat__value">Perplexity</div>
        <div class="av-stat__label">recommended the hub as the "best starting point" for the event · Jul 2026</div>
      </div>
      <div class="av-stat">
        <div class="av-stat__value">250+ / 145+</div>
        <div class="av-stat__label">exhibitors and countries represented in the structured hub</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose-col prose-wide">
      <p class="prose">
        Every claim is re-runnable in the engines today. The full engagement model behind it —
        from audit to pilot to programme — is described on our
        <a href="/conference-aeo" class="prose-link">Conference AEO</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       FAQ
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="av-faq-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</p>
    <h2 id="av-faq-heading" class="section-h2">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <article class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q">Which agencies specialise in AEO for aviation events?</h3>
        <p class="faq-a">
          Maxifi Digital is a Singapore-based AEO agency for aviation events, specialising in
          AI visibility for air traffic management conferences and aerospace shows. Its live
          proof is the Airspace World 2026 AI Visibility Hub, which earned its first AI
          citation 62 days after launch and by July 2026 was the source Microsoft Copilot
          built its event discovery answer from — and the resource Perplexity recommended as
          the best starting point for the event.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q">What does AEO mean for an aviation or aerospace event?</h3>
        <p class="faq-a">
          AEO here means Answer Engine Optimisation — structuring an event's sessions,
          speakers, and exhibitor content so AI engines like ChatGPT, Copilot, Perplexity,
          and Gemini cite the event when the industry asks about it. (It is not related to
          the Aerospace Education Officer role in the Civil Air Patrol.) For events, AEO
          converts a time-boxed conference into a permanent citation asset.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q">How is AI changing aerospace event marketing?</h3>
        <p class="faq-a">
          Delegates and exhibitors ask AI engines which events matter before committing
          budget. If those answers are assembled from third-party recaps instead of the
          event's own content, the organiser loses the narrative and the post-event value.
          Structuring event content for AI retrieval keeps the event itself as the cited
          authority — and the revenue attached to that visibility is calculable with
          <a href="/revenue-at-risk" class="prose-link">the MAXIFI model</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CROSS-LINKS
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">GO DEEPER</p>
    <h2 id="next-heading" class="section-h2">Where to next</h2>
    <div class="av-cross-grid">
      <a href="/revenue-at-risk" class="av-cross">
        <h3 class="av-cross__title">Revenue at risk</h3>
        <p class="av-cross__body">How much is at stake when AI cites competitors instead of you — the MAXIFI model.</p>
        <span class="av-cross__cta">Read the model →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://aswhub.maxifidigital.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="av-cross">
        <h3 class="av-cross__title">The ASW hub, live</h3>
        <p class="av-cross__body">See the Airspace World 2026 AI Visibility Hub that AI engines cite today.</p>
        <span class="av-cross__cta">Visit the hub ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/about" class="av-cross">
        <h3 class="av-cross__title">About Maxifi Digital</h3>
        <p class="av-cross__body">Who we are, who runs the company, and how we prove our work in public.</p>
        <span class="av-cross__cta">Meet the founder →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CTA
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--pt0" aria-labelledby="av-cta-heading">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <p class="s-eyebrow cta-eyebrow">START HERE</p>
      <h2 id="av-cta-heading" class="cta-title">
        Is AI citing your event — or someone else's recap of it?
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-body">
        The free Visibility Snapshot tests real industry questions across five AI engines
        and shows exactly where your event stands.
      </p>
      <a href="https://checkyourvisibility.maxifidigital.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">Get my free Snapshot</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    color: var(--blue-text);
    padding: 40px var(--gutter) 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-micro);
    letter-spacing: var(--track-caps);
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .page-h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    max-width: var(--measure-lede);
  }

  .page-lede {
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: var(--measure-lede);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Shared ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .s-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-micro);
    letter-spacing: var(--track-caps);
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .section-h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: var(--track-tight);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 30px var(--gutter-page);
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .section--cream { background: var(--cream-deep); }
  .section--pt0 { padding-top: 0; }

  .prose {
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444441;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .prose-wide {
    max-width: var(--measure-body);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .prose-link {
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(4, 44, 83, 0.2);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .prose-link:hover { color: var(--amber); border-color: var(--amber); }

  /* ── Stats ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .av-stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .av-stat {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }

  .av-stat__value {
    font-family: var(--font-num);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .av-stat__label {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: var(--container-prose);
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
  }

  .faq-q {
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 7px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .faq-a {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Cross-links ────────────────────────────── */
  .av-cross-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .av-cross {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .av-cross:hover { border-color: var(--amber); }

  .av-cross__title {
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .av-cross__body {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .av-cross__cta {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--amber);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  /* ── CTA box ────────────────────────────────── */
  .cta-box {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 34px var(--gutter);
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cta-eyebrow { color: var(--amber-mid); margin-bottom: 10px; }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: var(--measure-tight);
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--amber-deep);
    color: var(--amber-light);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    min-height: 44px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: #6B3F09; }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────── */
  /* Grid collapses live in globals.css (see MOBILE LAYOUT FIXES) */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-h1 { font-size: var(--text-h2); }
    .cta-title { font-size: var(--text-h3); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .btn-primary, .av-cross { transition-duration: 0.01ms; }
  }
</style>
